#: ../../src/api/index.rst:2
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API 参考文档"

#: ../../src/api/index.rst:4
msgid "The Glasgow API allows end users to customize the software for their particular application. The Glasgow CLI is built using the Glasgow API, and the two are decoupled as much as it is feasible."
msgstr "Glasgow API 允许终端用户为自己的应用场景自定义软件栈。Glasgow CLI 是使用 Glasgow API 构建的，而这两者在可行范围内尽量解耦。"

#: ../../src/api/index.rst:8
msgid "The API reference is a work in progress. Most modules have not been documented yet."
msgstr "API 参考文档尚未完成。大部分模块还没有对应的文档。"

